 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Tool calls now reach executors only after passing their declared JSON Schema. Invalid calls return a readable tool result so the model can correct the input within the configured tool-round limit. Executors that previously handled malformed input themselves no longer receive it; keep any custom message in the schema description or in a valid-input response. Extra properties remain available unless the schema forbids them.
+- Invalid static tool input schemas now fail when the tool is registered, with an error naming the tool, instead of reaching a conversation with a broken declaration.
+
